Package: qio
Title: Read and Write 'Apache Parquet' Files
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", email = "pedrobtz@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Johan HG", "Natter", role = c("aut", "cph"),
           comment = "carquet source code (MIT license)"),
    person(given = "vctrs authors", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "qio_s3_register() helper (MIT license)"))
Description: Read and write 'Apache Parquet' files. Whole files are read with
    a single call, and larger ones can be opened to inspect their schema and
    read selected columns, row groups, or batches. Built on the bundled C
    library 'carquet', with no required R package dependencies.
URL: https://pedrobtz.github.io/qio/, https://github.com/pedrobtz/qio
BugReports: https://github.com/pedrobtz/qio/issues
